# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendor material. Kept local, deliberately.
#
# These are a recording of another company's product demo: a verbatim
# transcript naming their presenter, its subtitles, and a teardown written as
# competitive intelligence. This repository is public, so publishing them would
# put a third party's commercial conversation online under our name. They stay
# on the machines of people who were in the meeting.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/meeting-*.srt
docs/meeting-*-transcript.txt
docs/contentverse-product-teardown.md
